{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual 3D Platforming adventure about a beaver on a journey to find a new home. Waddle, jump, and bounce your way through the wilderness. Harness the power of water physics to overcome obstacles. Meet cute animals, avoid ghosts from the past, and gnaw your way to a brighter future!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with dynamic water physics as you build dams piece by piece, creating lush ecosystems for wildlife and unlocking your path forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey at your own pace -- there's no need to rush! No timers, no health bar, no UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend other animals along your travels, you might be able to help each other out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush original soundtrack by Ryan Probert that progresses dynamically as you explore the wilderness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759000?t=1767765635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/dffff116999f14f643a64676a1f8092ae90e921c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767765635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/c1a056026199e910b1f4891f1866dba11cccbde0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767765635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/c1a056026199e910b1f4891f1866dba11cccbde0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767765635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual 3D Platforming adventure about a beaver on a journey to find a new home. Waddle, jump, and bounce your way through the wilderness. Harness the power of water physics to overcome obstacles. Meet cute animals, avoid ghosts from the past, and gnaw your way to a brighter future!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with dynamic water physics as you build dams piece by piece, creating lush ecosystems for wildlife and unlocking your path forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey at your own pace -- there's no need to rush! No timers, no health bar, no UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend other animals along your travels, you might be able to help each other out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush original soundtrack by Ryan Probert that progresses dynamically as you explore the wilderness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["We Shall Be Monsters"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/e9313d7a30687b38517a445deed378cb4b2a7fa9/header.jpg?t=1767765635","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759000/575680227/82d74bd8e972712abc6536d04ee621582285ea22/1760744040/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760745123","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759000/575680227/82d74bd8e972712abc6536d04ee621582285ea22/1760744040/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760745123","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759000/575680227/82d74bd8e972712abc6536d04ee621582285ea22/1760744040/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760745123","id":257179509,"name":"Beaver Creek Announcement Trailer","thumbn